"The Sdyelis Branch is an oasis ship being built in the forest near Vethedya's healing grove."
"It is ovoid and irregular, larger than any spaceship Alden had imagined."
"It is built entirely of materials native to the Mother, with minimal traveler's knowledge."
"It is meant to be the nearest thing to sending a piece of the Mother anywhere."
"It should ease some magics and give a haven where rest can't normally be found."
"A wizard from Rapport III has devoted her life to designing it; she and her children run it."
"It is meant for the Primary's campaign to reopen a way sealed off by chaos long ago."
